476\nうちの子参考②\nhttps://twitter.com/Air_TypeScarlet/status/1478296418687516676\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YOSHIDA_HD/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c1204045/uploads/origins/f2b383a7-959c-4559-833c-5c467f78c5a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=851fcb2583f6b276fe1d1ec174ce375f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c1204045/uploads/origins/f2b383a7-959c-4559-833c-5c467f78c5a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=851fcb2583f6b276fe1d1ec174ce375f, https://si.imgix.net/c1204045/uploads/origins/f2b383a7-959c-4559-833c-5c467f78c5a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c25f33176a84443a89b36f341cd9b294 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c1204045/uploads/origins/f2b383a7-959c-4559-833c-5c467f78c5a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4ec3e08aef39e61ad5562a7532d289e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。\nうちのこの兎を描いて頂きたく、リクエスト送らせて頂きました。\nよしだ先生に好きに描いて頂きたいので構図等はお任せしますが\n服装の状態は設定画の胸元のジッパーを開けた状態だと嬉しいです。\nあと胸はよしだ先生好みに盛って頂いて構いません！\n\nお忙しい中とは思いますが、ご検討の方をよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/zbftio09wc9msb3/AADYLSajtswPw0vEVSxgNN1Wa?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@YOSHIDA_HD/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/88f1cc3b/uploads/origins/aed461c8-e873-4c14-93a7-f32b4952d57e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9095a493ae76ac52ba3002b848e3d566", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88f1cc3b/uploads/origins/aed461c8-e873-4c14-93a7-f32b4952d57e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9095a493ae76ac52ba3002b848e3d566, https://si.imgix.net/88f1cc3b/uploads/origins/aed461c8-e873-4c14-93a7-f32b4952d57e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffdf76325b7f3ea597fe787f8a33fb56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88f1cc3b/uploads